" Taskologic | Dashboard                                                               alice (admin) "
"                                                                                                    "
"  New board   Analytics   / Search   ? Help                                                   More  "
"                                                                                                    "
" ┌ Keys ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐  "
" │ Arrows / hjkl   Move selection                D               Delete board (dashboard)        │  "
" │ Tab / Shift+Tab Next / previous column        B               Board settings (owner, admin)   │  "
" │ Enter           Open task or board            m               Members                         │  "
" │ Space           Pick up task, again to drop   c               Columns (owner, admin)          │┐ "
" │ Arrows          Move the picked up task       S               Settings                        ││ "
" │ n               New task in current column    u               Users and admins (admin)        ││ "
" │ e               Edit selected task            b               Back to the dashboard           │┘ "
" │ d               Delete task, to the archive   M               More menu                       │  "
" │ a               Archive (v views, D purges)   s               Manual scan mode, if enabled    │┐ "
" │ t               Sort column by due date       p               Print selected task, if enabled ││ "
" │ A               Analytics (time taken)        F2              Save the open form              │┘ "
" │ T               Templates   P  Programs       ?               This overlay                    │  "
" │ /               Search   i  include archived  Esc             Close overlay / cancel          │  "
" │ N               New board (dashboard)         q               Quit (confirm)                  │  "
" └───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘  "
"                                                                                                    "
"                                                                                                    "
"                                                                                                    "
" Enter opens a board   D deletes it   / searches                                                    "
